With a bit of care and pruning it is nowadays feasible to check 10^120
states. However, the resulting if-tree will not look like the
original rule based system at all, and it will not give you a deep
understanding of how the game works. 

>Start playing with it.  I promise you that you'll learn a lot.

That is for certain. Software archaeology and reverse engineering
by automatic model checking can be great fun.

scsprong


