Read the LEDs as 8 bits or 2 hex digits.  A lit LED is a 1 bit.

Your system stops with DD displayed on the LEDs, which is the normal
display after the power-on self tests complete.  If you have the console
device connected correctly, you should see the SRM console prompt >>> .

After you boot an OS, the LEDs will be 00, all off.

